Error [E0968]: `nixos-24.05` isn't a `provider@target` source ref
  --> env.jet:3:25
    |
  3 |     sources: { default: nixos-24.05 }
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a named source resolves to an upstream written as `provider@target` (U6) — `github@owner/repo/rev`, `path@../local`, `nixpkgs@channel`
 Fix: write the ref as `provider@target`, e.g. `github@NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-24.05`
